	measure Rolling12MSpend = ```
			
			CALCULATE(
			    SUM(sam_concur_pcard[$ Spend]),
			    DATESINPERIOD(
			        'sam_concur_pcard'[transaction_date],
			        MAX(sam_concur_pcard[transaction_date]),
			        -12,
			        MONTH
			    ),
			    REMOVEFILTERS('sam_concur_pcard'[transaction_date])
			)
			
			```
		displayFolder: pcard
		lineageTag: a6c01659-5031-4bd4-be6b-9103c51d7271

