	measure '% Spend Under Contract' = ```
			
			DIVIDE(
			    CALCULATE(
			        SUM(sam_coupa_invoices_lines[$ Spend]),
			        NOT ISBLANK(sam_coupa_invoices_lines[contract_id]   )
			    ),
			    SUM(sam_coupa_invoices_lines[$ Spend]),
			    0
			    
			    )
			    
			
			```
