	measure 'Adjusted #Suppliers' = ```
			
			VAR SelectedPercentage = SELECTEDVALUE('Spend %'[Parameter], 0)
			RETURN 
			DISTINCTCOUNT(sam_coupa_invoices_lines[header_supplier_number]) * ( SelectedPercentage / 100)
			
			```
