	measure 'Average Days to Pay' = ```
			
			AVERAGEX(
			    FILTER(
			        brl_sap_payments_GL,
			        NOT ISBLANK(brl_sap_payments_GL[AP_Baseline_Date]) &&
			        NOT ISBLANK(brl_sap_payments_GL[AP_Clearing_Date])
			    ),
			    DATEDIFF(
			        brl_sap_payments_GL[AP_Baseline_Date],
			        brl_sap_payments_GL[AP_Clearing_Date],
			        DAY
			    )
			)
			
			```
